<view class="home-page">
  <view class="hero-card">
    <text class="eyebrow">MVP 演示版</text>
    <text class="hero-title">AI 口腔客服陪练</text>
    <text class="hero-desc">和 AI 模拟患者进行多轮文字对练，训练沟通、需求挖掘和医疗合规表达。</text>
    <button class="primary-button" bindtap="goTraining">开始训练</button>
  </view>

  <view class="demo-notice">
    <text class="notice-title">固定演示用户</text>
    <text class="notice-desc">当前使用演示数据，不需要微信授权登录，也不会处理真实患者信息。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="entry-list">
    <view class="entry-card" bindtap="goHistory">
      <view class="entry-icon">↺</view>
      <view class="entry-copy">
        <text class="entry-title">历史记录</text>
        <text class="entry-desc">查看训练状态、完整对话和评分报告</text>
      </view>
      <text class="entry-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="entry-card" bindtap="goDashboard">
      <view class="entry-icon">▥</view>
      <view class="entry-copy">
        <text class="entry-title">演示数据</text>
        <text class="entry-desc">查看训练次数、场景统计和五维平均分</text>
      </view>
      <text class="entry-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="boundary-card">
    <text class="boundary-title">使用边界</text>
    <text class="boundary-text">AI 只扮演模拟患者，评分仅用于演示和训练反馈，不构成医疗建议或正式考核。</text>
  </view>
</view>
